# `wsl --shutdown` with the rs27-mini project from 02 running, Compose run from the Ubuntu WSL distro
# (sidecar = alpine:3 + the script bind-mounted from the distro; supervisor's /var/run/docker.sock also from the distro).
# Shutdown 1 was run by windows-watch.ps1 -Mode WslShutdown (log below). Shutdown 2 was run by the Self-hoster by hand
# about 16 minutes later; its result was read afterwards with after-restart.sh and docker inspect.

