08:46:54 wsl --shutdown
08:47:03 wsl --shutdown returned; distros: * Ubuntu Running 2; docker-desktop Stopped 2
         (Ubuntu was already running again 9 s later; most likely the T3 Code desktop app reconnecting to it)
08:47:12 engine up: 29.9.2; distros: * Ubuntu Running 2; docker-desktop Running 2
08:47:13 rules: v4 14 (INPUT 2), v6 7
08:47:13 rs27-mini-computer-egress-1    running restarts=0 started=08:47:11.09
08:47:13 rs27-mini-supervisor-1         running restarts=0 started=08:47:11.07
