08:47:14 live Instance (rakazo-supervisor-1, rakazo-web-1, lemonade-server): running, started=08:47:11
supervisor 08:47:13 "supervisor listening"; 08:47:21 "restricted computer egress verified"
=> pass, because the distro was back before the engine restarted containers

