  err=OCI runtime create failed: … error mounting "/run/desktop/mnt/host/wsl/docker-desktop-bind-mounts/Ubuntu/<hash>"
      to rootfs at "/restrict-computer-egress.sh": … not a directory: Are you trying to mount a directory onto a file …
rs27-mini-supervisor-1       exited exit=127 restarts=0 policy=unless-stopped
  err=OCI runtime create failed: … error mounting "/run/desktop/mnt/host/wsl/docker-desktop-bind-mounts/Ubuntu/docker.sock"
      to rootfs at "/var/run/docker.sock": … not a directory …
